2. Third-Party Community Assets & Strict Non-Commercial Terms
-------------------------------------------------------------
AeroGraph bundles and executes community-created simulation assets with immense
gratitude. All third-party assets remain under the exclusive copyright,
intellectual property, and distribution terms of their original creators:

* FoxVox Application, Falcon BMS Profile & Audio Recordings:
  - FoxVox application and the Falcon BMS 4.38 v1.3.1 VCC profile (.fvx)
    are created and authored by "foxster" (https://foxster.itch.io/foxvox).
  - Original pilot response audio, ground crew recordings, and sound design
    were created and performed by "Bogey Dope" (https://www.youtube.com/@BogeyDope)
    and distributed with permission for non-commercial flight sim use.
  - Startup procedure contribution by "Tomcattwo".
  - FoxVox is NOT replaced by AeroGraph; profile editing and authoring belong
    exclusively to FoxVox.

* EZBoards / EZCharts:
  - Foundational concept of automated briefing.txt extraction and initial
    kneeboard layout/checklist designs are created by "Logic"
    (Falcon BMS Community: https://forum.falcon-bms.com/topic/19901/ezboards-instant-single-click-briefing-to-kneeboards-conversion).
  - Note: Airfield vector geometry databases, dynamic wind calculation engines,
    and map cropping pipelines in AeroGraph are original creations by
    Yağız Işkırık and were not part of original EZBoards.

* STRICT NON-COMMERCIAL RESTRICTION ON THIRD-PARTY ASSETS:
  - Bundled third-party community assets (including but not limited to .fvx
    profile files, audio cues/recordings, HTML/CSS checklist templates, and
    airfield database files) are strictly prohibited from being sold, monetized,
    paywalled, or incorporated into commercial products or services.
  - In compliance with Benchmark Sims (BMS) policies and the non-commercial
    nature of Falcon BMS community modifications, these assets are distributed
    exclusively for personal, non-commercial simulation use by community pilots.
  - Sublicensing of third-party assets under the MIT License is explicitly
    prohibited.


3. Community Good-Faith Notice & Author Removal Policy
------------------------------------------------------
AeroGraph is developed in good faith by a passionate simulation enthusiast to
serve the Falcon BMS community.

If any original author or copyright holder (foxster, Bogey Dope, Logic, or
Benchmark Sims) objects to the inclusion, bundling, or distribution of their
assets within AeroGraph:
  1. The author or contributor may request the unbundling or removal of their
     assets at any time.
  2. The maintainer will immediately comply and remove the bundled assets from
     the repository and installer releases.
  3. AeroGraph will transition to a decoupled mode where users provide their own
     installed profile or assets from their existing sim installations.


4. Third-Party Binaries & Libraries
-----------------------------------
* wkhtmltoimage (assets/bin/wkhtmltoimage.exe):
  - Standalone headless WebKit image rendering utility, licensed under GNU LGPLv3.
  - Source code available at: https://github.com/wkhtmltopdf/wkhtmltopdf
